      "content": "this is exactly what i need. looking at how the British justified things, it seems like their side of the story was mostly just propaganda to hide the violence. do you think there were any legitimate arguments the colonial government had for staying in Kenya, or was it basically just an attempt to keep control of the resources by any means necessary?",
